flags: -O

--- OUT --->
42
--- IR --->
// the two data pointers *do* hoist - an address-typed field and a uint64 store are different types.
// the **length** does not: it is a uint64 like the elements, so a store into an element may, as far
// as any type-based rule can tell, be a store into the length. so the loop keeps this reload and
// cannot vectorize, where tbaa_hoists_container_header shows int32 doing both.
//
// when regions land, this directive is what has to change
CHECK: %len.i = load i64
